            <ArticleTitle>A technique for the evaluation of the left ventricle contraction.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>17-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A new method of left ventricle contraction evaluation using radiance is submitted. The reference point is not established a priori. It is the point where the function given by contraction variability and its magnitude has the minimum. This minimum can be considered as the contraction evaluating parameter.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
